Package: ebolamongbwalu
Type: Project
Title: Epidemiological Analysis Pipeline of the MSF Ebola Treatment Centre in Mongbwalu (DRC)
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Stephanie", "Ngai", role = c("aut")),
    person("Aboubacar", "Hema", email = "aboubacarhema94@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Abdul Salam", "Mbengue", role = c("ctb"), comment = "Analysis plan"))
Description: Data cleaning, data quality checks, weekly epidemiological sitrep
    and descriptive/bivariate analyses of the line list of the MSF Ebola
    treatment centre of Mongbwalu (Bundibugyo ebolavirus outbreak, Ituri,
    Democratic Republic of the Congo, 2026). This file only declares
    dependencies; the project is not an R package.
